                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Survey among the inhabitants of Nijmegen. Sex and age of respondent, whether respondent and-or respondent's parents were born in the Netherlands / duration  of living in Nijmegen / occupation and occupational history / education / relationships(s) / religious matters / health matters / watching tv / reading books and newspapers / living situation when respondent was between 12 and 15 years old , background variables of parents / present contacts with parents /  political preference /  local politics / income / use of car /  outlook on thinking /  philosophy of life / feeling attracked to eastern  philosophies /  respondents' moods during the last few weeks /  influence of partner on a persons life /  effects of watching tv on children  / attitude towards a refugee centre in r.'s neighbourhood  / attitude towards a mosque in r.'s neighbourhood / attutide towards schools with predominantly children from ethnic minorities /  political priorities / opinion about gender roles / social security</p>"
